  "selected_alignment_score_max": 0.67,
  "segments": [
    {
      "sentence_index": 1,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The latest invention on the market is the wasp gun.",
      "output_sha256": "c2429c446300641cbc7650f8e32c7db7ce568a6df8fa2a6cb462651915389c86",
      "alignment_unit_index": 1,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 1,
      "source_human_sha256": "c2429c446300641cbc7650f8e32c7db7ce568a6df8fa2a6cb462651915389c86",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 2,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "In theory it is something like a letter clip; you pull the trigger and the upper and lower plates snap together with a suddenness which would surprise any insect in between.",
      "output_sha256": "6e8b0795850fbf2b3ae921f0aee6656431865a458df66a425e12fbfa2aca1bee",
      "alignment_unit_index": 2,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 2,
      "source_human_sha256": "6e8b0795850fbf2b3ae921f0aee6656431865a458df66a425e12fbfa2aca1bee",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 3,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The trouble will be to get him in the right place before firing.",
      "output_sha256": "111512d86d4948aa30606e0b3e414c36fccf86dbe0b9b1042abadb64886771f1",
      "alignment_unit_index": 3,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 3,
      "source_human_sha256": "111512d86d4948aa30606e0b3e414c36fccf86dbe0b9b1042abadb64886771f1",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 4,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "But I can see that a lot of fun can be got out of a wasp drive.",
      "output_sha256": "46c9f76c332f1f3df0aa9b16ae87a16d6b71dac575fdaf584d9683b3e7b6fd6b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 4,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 4,
      "source_human_sha256": "46c9f76c332f1f3df0aa9b16ae87a16d6b71dac575fdaf584d9683b3e7b6fd6b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 5,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Picture us stationed at the edge of the marmalade, while the beaters work through the spread; with enough wasp guns on hand, few insects will manage to escape.",
      "output_sha256": "2a7146ba1db7b683856f390e97ccb83c5a24dab06f5c73ff13e68d538d444f19",
      "alignment_unit_index": 5,
      "alignment_score": 0.513584,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "707b8ec2a39166a5add1edc1cf56e69e196cb81c3c958d66102400e87eff13f4"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 5,
      "source_ai_sha256": "2a7146ba1db7b683856f390e97ccb83c5a24dab06f5c73ff13e68d538d444f19",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 6,
      "paragraph_index": 1,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A loader to clean the weapon at regular intervals will be a necessity.",
      "output_sha256": "04b112be27b15266bbefa7f4c041b74026e170a39844c14d25f10ecffdad16a2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 6,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 6,
      "source_human_sha256": "04b112be27b15266bbefa7f4c041b74026e170a39844c14d25f10ecffdad16a2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 7,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Nonetheless, I harbor concerns that society may frown upon the wasp gun.",
      "output_sha256": "52f52c0ed37d1eb7726f3406796915657a7e0d543c3c1c854cca80361a0e47f6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 7,
      "alignment_score": 0.516615,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "7288c06f0f95f8da02b30a8cfed263007964acde409dbb19f520146cee0f1db2"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 7,
      "source_ai_sha256": "52f52c0ed37d1eb7726f3406796915657a7e0d543c3c1c854cca80361a0e47f6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        7
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 8,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Anything useful and handy is always barred by the best people.",
      "output_sha256": "5768de5344cc129348e7a7b7d3287340c3abfbd866fc1addc623e45c9d17fd6d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 8,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 8,
      "source_human_sha256": "5768de5344cc129348e7a7b7d3287340c3abfbd866fc1addc623e45c9d17fd6d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 9,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "I can easily envision a pompous individual being labeled as “the type who would opt for a wasp gun over a teaspoon.”",
      "output_sha256": "ef9a4df97c88c69bfe8e2fd22d3497890dab80018b52913f0c21f2e5825f33fa",
      "alignment_unit_index": 9,
      "alignment_score": 0.5385,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "d6014faa170e6e5c149f4746c8640dc6f6ed14f2e5dac16ab694c3af30015d37"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 9,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ef9a4df97c88c69bfe8e2fd22d3497890dab80018b52913f0c21f2e5825f33fa",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        9
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 10,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "As we all know, a hat- guard is the mark of a very low fellow.",
      "output_sha256": "1471a126abffb0700bdc0e585c0af8fa2b048f4a744178967e3ba2add559a229",
      "alignment_unit_index": 10,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 10,
      "source_human_sha256": "1471a126abffb0700bdc0e585c0af8fa2b048f4a744178967e3ba2add559a229",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 11,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The underlying belief seems to be that individuals like you and me, being somewhat affluent, are indifferent to the loss of our straw hats, which could easily blow away into the Serpentine.",
      "output_sha256": "e32678e92af0ae458f9853caebf1f20f751ea4931e1b43f39b6a806b1a66429b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.501377,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "412c2079f55c949d7426768bee868bf957bbab6d74c0abd4c00f36429443e301"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 11,
      "source_ai_sha256": "e32678e92af0ae458f9853caebf1f20f751ea4931e1b43f39b6a806b1a66429b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11,
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 12,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It is only the unfortunate clerk, who can’t afford a new hat each day, that must take precautions to safeguard his only one.",
      "output_sha256": "40b39b7fdf8c8ce97e7731c3be73be5e4e5c5f0bd6e9d7dc85a754085de16677",
      "alignment_unit_index": 11,
      "alignment_score": 0.501377,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        11
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "412c2079f55c949d7426768bee868bf957bbab6d74c0abd4c00f36429443e301"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_ai_sha256": "40b39b7fdf8c8ce97e7731c3be73be5e4e5c5f0bd6e9d7dc85a754085de16677",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        11,
        12
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 13,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yet how neat, how useful, is the hat-guard.",
      "output_sha256": "b321408c0977116de7c31bc7739e9814dfdfb2de9a66358534f5bbb7d1dcc948",
      "alignment_unit_index": 12,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 12,
      "source_human_sha256": "b321408c0977116de7c31bc7739e9814dfdfb2de9a66358534f5bbb7d1dcc948",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 14,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "One can only imagine the pride its inventor felt upon creating it.",
      "output_sha256": "1974719911e4b975147dff4a40b56769a1c683a2da14669679ca3b6d71ce65c4",
      "alignment_unit_index": 13,
      "alignment_score": 0.386009,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        13
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "3d0322cd046c3ae2b843168d279b1c36ce01c319007360a76a3cc16d549ac029"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1974719911e4b975147dff4a40b56769a1c683a2da14669679ca3b6d71ce65c4",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 15,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Probably he expected a statue at the corner of Cromwell Road, fitting reward for a public benefactor.",
      "output_sha256": "2c45e36f44caff00ecde40eb6d9fa440150e6bb713d94302ccd3e2bea02bc16e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 14,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 14,
      "source_human_sha256": "2c45e36f44caff00ecde40eb6d9fa440150e6bb713d94302ccd3e2bea02bc16e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 16,
      "paragraph_index": 2,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It’s unfortunate he didn’t grasp that the utility of his creation likely deemed it socially unacceptable.",
      "output_sha256": "1347a2d4b7419123c94b29c62ea5fedcacd73eb27fb37eb2c213303f0dbe6db2",
      "alignment_unit_index": 15,
      "alignment_score": 0.303629,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        15
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "686099372093b008e00801f288e208b72be9f5d5fd671ee79f645bced176b345"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1347a2d4b7419123c94b29c62ea5fedcacd73eb27fb37eb2c213303f0dbe6db2",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        16
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 17,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Consider, again, the Richard or \"dicky.\"",
      "output_sha256": "3690e3d712548518c2c4cca30b4d20e3692f3146d8daade0511172c84c0f1108",
      "alignment_unit_index": 16,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 16,
      "source_human_sha256": "3690e3d712548518c2c4cca30b4d20e3692f3146d8daade0511172c84c0f1108",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 18,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Could there be anything neater or more dressy, anything more thoroughly useful?",
      "output_sha256": "3db850753c8e63353446030f64f5759498b86d52515f3f6f0bfe18e89fe26e0d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 17,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 17,
      "source_human_sha256": "3db850753c8e63353446030f64f5759498b86d52515f3f6f0bfe18e89fe26e0d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 19,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yet you and I scorn to wear one.",
      "output_sha256": "b336f2265a76702316e4678add10c75b2b81c82f297a484c86863c09595b8fa7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 18,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 18,
      "source_human_sha256": "b336f2265a76702316e4678add10c75b2b81c82f297a484c86863c09595b8fa7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 20,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I remember a terrible situation in a story by Mr. W. S. Jackson.",
      "output_sha256": "d028b888d30b3b125e9d02ef56aa0f2d66c6e5f194901442bd7397fda1d39e5b",
      "alignment_unit_index": 19,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 19,
      "source_human_sha256": "d028b888d30b3b125e9d02ef56aa0f2d66c6e5f194901442bd7397fda1d39e5b",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 21,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The hero found himself in a foreign hotel without his luggage.",
      "output_sha256": "45b5a0d6e2f50950a8b657517795d4340ec7767ce5e02d2e0b597c82d206ebc8",
      "alignment_unit_index": 20,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 20,
      "source_human_sha256": "45b5a0d6e2f50950a8b657517795d4340ec7767ce5e02d2e0b597c82d206ebc8",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 22,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "To that hotel came, with her father, the girl whom he adored silently.",
      "output_sha256": "fd74dd12d40d4181c9d9ff4604c9eef91730a3b84c1c6a057dc152d4cfb68c50",
      "alignment_unit_index": 21,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 21,
      "source_human_sha256": "fd74dd12d40d4181c9d9ff4604c9eef91730a3b84c1c6a057dc152d4cfb68c50",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 23,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He received an invitation to dine with them, but in a pinch, he had to borrow clothes from accommodating waiters, one of which included a dicky.",
      "output_sha256": "cee4ea66d1bae287d59fb3f82e1bfdbddfe7b9ae847eaa53bce828c9610d0dad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 22,
      "alignment_score": 0.554352,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        22,
        23
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "c8645691e4bad2019faf14f822e5661e12455e589819935662c019db16834434",
        "d9b8a87e35dbeefadc689ac8e6e2d416d8287a2116b1dde7661b0e0e17f1deb3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 23,
      "source_ai_sha256": "cee4ea66d1bae287d59fb3f82e1bfdbddfe7b9ae847eaa53bce828c9610d0dad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 24,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The dinner commenced splendidly, and our hero made a good impression, with the atmosphere filled with joy.",
      "output_sha256": "9422edd2da5ec47686264504dcb485fc64e22d822cb20c6c5f62ec2cc08fa00f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 23,
      "alignment_score": 0.418899,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4e43927809dda46b8de8897c8f1550a511e80140ae387b11c1e1b3798e786f7b"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 24,
      "source_ai_sha256": "9422edd2da5ec47686264504dcb485fc64e22d822cb20c6c5f62ec2cc08fa00f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        24
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 25,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "However, chaos erupted when a candle was accidentally knocked over, igniting the heroine's dress.",
      "output_sha256": "7006416bbf4cafbad97b69d785b3ac8d37e28122ad9e7c7373d3a2318b320c2c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 24,
      "alignment_score": 0.382005,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "4ef29d66e4f6d220e34e96ec8a9fcc9371c60ddbaed2d9a63ea8004ed5d52db0"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 25,
      "source_ai_sha256": "7006416bbf4cafbad97b69d785b3ac8d37e28122ad9e7c7373d3a2318b320c2c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        25
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 26,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In that moment, the hero instinctively understood the need to act, recalling how heroes traditionally remove their coats to wrap around burning damsels.",
      "output_sha256": "0b1c10673c5bddc40158861546bf1652f59d26d67d487294b69e47f2c1f47bef",
      "alignment_unit_index": 25,
      "alignment_score": 0.408997,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        26,
        27
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "295c8c573adc1d8db2e67cb74ba0b1c1ba39d9c92c1b57694f91f3585d60f488",
        "35069ad4a9ef4dbc68e0fbab3a497efce86cb6291841e739d726d2357280427a"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 26,
      "source_ai_sha256": "0b1c10673c5bddc40158861546bf1652f59d26d67d487294b69e47f2c1f47bef",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 27,
      "paragraph_index": 3,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "He jumped up like a bullet (or whatever jumps up quickest) and —remembered.",
      "output_sha256": "97b84be4df97fba41aae159027b140cd842cd623383f007f69517a88e1086a78",
      "alignment_unit_index": 26,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_human_sha256": "97b84be4df97fba41aae159027b140cd842cd623383f007f69517a88e1086a78",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 28,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "He was wearing a dicky!",
      "output_sha256": "de4dc28d4c34baab66b39acefc1a8c0d655f7995245e151dccc9f77c18755b58",
      "alignment_unit_index": 27,
      "alignment_score": 0.67,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        29
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "0682775e6881a3020a88bd4cab7b327339db89904b9b102f1b78a17bd4e25ba1"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 28,
      "source_ai_sha256": "de4dc28d4c34baab66b39acefc1a8c0d655f7995245e151dccc9f77c18755b58",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        28
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 29,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Without his coat, he would discover the dicky to the one person of all from whom he wished to hide it.",
      "output_sha256": "f5bbeb75180df2e83beaa08b8037511a653856e241af41eea48a098ca25ec29d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 28,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 30,
      "source_human_sha256": "f5bbeb75180df2e83beaa08b8037511a653856e241af41eea48a098ca25ec29d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 30,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Yet if he kept his coat on, she might die.",
      "output_sha256": "c8f833354bc22931a5af21b5bf6e0d422a895e3a8f41692c8bf78e6f43bcf475",
      "alignment_unit_index": 29,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 31,
      "source_human_sha256": "c8f833354bc22931a5af21b5bf6e0d422a895e3a8f41692c8bf78e6f43bcf475",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 31,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A truly horrible dilemma.",
      "output_sha256": "537d9a70d586846a6e1bef98b1619c9ba1d80c31d50962bd42e506a3b34e3e01",
      "alignment_unit_index": 30,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 32,
      "source_human_sha256": "537d9a70d586846a6e1bef98b1619c9ba1d80c31d50962bd42e506a3b34e3e01",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 32,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I forget which horn he impaled himself upon, but I expect you and I would have kept the secret of the Richard at all costs.",
      "output_sha256": "08ebdaec98e391b54998f05de226e5af81200e7d3edd920d247c6a5d52ff9780",
      "alignment_unit_index": 31,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 33,
      "source_human_sha256": "08ebdaec98e391b54998f05de226e5af81200e7d3edd920d247c6a5d52ff9780",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 33,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "And what really is wrong with a false shirt-front?",
      "output_sha256": "83280688f6a016300318eac018ad28c11f3a4e3bc80f183a40891292e07fa74e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 32,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_human_sha256": "83280688f6a016300318eac018ad28c11f3a4e3bc80f183a40891292e07fa74e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 34,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "The only issue it poses is the impression of the wearer’s financial situation.",
      "output_sha256": "3fa68535decfe8c533eb2ef1dea2985fab04dc078af244722dbaa8534a9c7985",
      "alignment_unit_index": 33,
      "alignment_score": 0.310368,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        35
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "813970cfc9428e07262c68143ec84a3fd88c99edfc531055ddd1f6d39241e132"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 34,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3fa68535decfe8c533eb2ef1dea2985fab04dc078af244722dbaa8534a9c7985",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        34
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 35,
      "paragraph_index": 4,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Laundry bills don't worry us, bless you, who have a new straw hat every day; but how terrible if it was suspected that they did.",
      "output_sha256": "271741441a27f1fcf108e0a6bd2e1d864e3036ebda95b15762580c9605398ff7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 34,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_human_sha256": "271741441a27f1fcf108e0a6bd2e1d864e3036ebda95b15762580c9605398ff7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 36,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Our gentlemanly objection to the made-up tie seems to rest on a different foundation; I am doubtful as to the psychology of that.",
      "output_sha256": "fb15ca421dd1303e6def22700d4618d94bdefc32f61776639ef7875515660ec0",
      "alignment_unit_index": 35,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_human_sha256": "fb15ca421dd1303e6def22700d4618d94bdefc32f61776639ef7875515660ec0",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 37,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Of course it is a deception, but a deception is only serious when it passes itself off as something which really matters.",
      "output_sha256": "d292ddf26228a61a41ea32b53a263b79c83f1af59d374cf41e52cbd7f1abba37",
      "alignment_unit_index": 36,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 38,
      "source_human_sha256": "d292ddf26228a61a41ea32b53a263b79c83f1af59d374cf41e52cbd7f1abba37",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 38,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Nobody thinks that a self-tied tie matters; nobody is really proud of being able to make a cravat out of a length of silk.",
      "output_sha256": "95d6110d0a8c77e7e7c40790a451e470adc1c92fd3f5c04fd526efb89a92bef6",
      "alignment_unit_index": 37,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_human_sha256": "95d6110d0a8c77e7e7c40790a451e470adc1c92fd3f5c04fd526efb89a92bef6",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 39,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I suppose it is simply the fact that a made-up tie saves time which condemns it; the safety razor was nearly condemned for a like reason.",
      "output_sha256": "17f3931bb1d22f6e03a0dab776ebe6d6bd1f7926f7189a3f56f4658021cbab14",
      "alignment_unit_index": 38,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 40,
      "source_human_sha256": "17f3931bb1d22f6e03a0dab776ebe6d6bd1f7926f7189a3f56f4658021cbab14",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 40,
      "paragraph_index": 5,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We of the leisured classes can spend hours over our toilet; by all means let us despise those who cannot.",
      "output_sha256": "b88587b1726c49307c7c0e1a48847ec5c9bd6f1c426e2cc32b02ad5ac6e2ee00",
      "alignment_unit_index": 39,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 41,
      "source_human_sha256": "b88587b1726c49307c7c0e1a48847ec5c9bd6f1c426e2cc32b02ad5ac6e2ee00",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 41,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When it comes to attire, a gentleman often only learns about the taboos of dressing.",
      "output_sha256": "c3a7be06d15df22e875ca9cafe1cce9cb1294bd1eaf2f21cd161ef01a5d4c4d3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 40,
      "alignment_score": 0.291263,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "bc8d1739b9d0bf90145c5bbd0d15764d996d22c413c9edb37665d0394c4408a5"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 36,
      "source_ai_sha256": "c3a7be06d15df22e875ca9cafe1cce9cb1294bd1eaf2f21cd161ef01a5d4c4d3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        36
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 42,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "It would be intriguing if women could enlighten us on what behaviors are deemed unacceptable for a true lady.",
      "output_sha256": "3eeda6d2972de41b1b24fa86c84a9669fb622742bf60ce62193d88fd7ece1fd7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 41,
      "alignment_score": 0.502993,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        43
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "b896e703eeaefdd316d8e580e0c4482e0b705e015522a0df45937f29c77bec7d"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 37,
      "source_ai_sha256": "3eeda6d2972de41b1b24fa86c84a9669fb622742bf60ce62193d88fd7ece1fd7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        37
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 43,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have heard a woman classified contemptuously as one who does her hair up with two hair-pins, and no doubt bad feminine form can be observed in other shocking directions.",
      "output_sha256": "596cbfe174a5e43b1952141870e667e48f200ed4470110cb6745fcc77b6c5b37",
      "alignment_unit_index": 42,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 44,
      "source_human_sha256": "596cbfe174a5e43b1952141870e667e48f200ed4470110cb6745fcc77b6c5b37",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 44,
      "paragraph_index": 6,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Yet, it seems the appearance of financial struggle, whether from lack of means or leisure, is the chief offense that must be avoided at all costs.",
      "output_sha256": "ffd9b726f2c13fc85255cc76a91763f0cf74619cf0f0a29491f5d2f53dd8b1ad",
      "alignment_unit_index": 43,
      "alignment_score": 0.529367,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "07c2e1b3ef98ef4433f933dc5f3e6f6f950a5b48c683675fb5de35ae5821a562"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 39,
      "source_ai_sha256": "ffd9b726f2c13fc85255cc76a91763f0cf74619cf0f0a29491f5d2f53dd8b1ad",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        39
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 45,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Why, then, should the wasp gun be considered bad form?",
      "output_sha256": "1a257fcd2755c65f738cfa51485bc24890888bf59a5253a1d430af901f8b0890",
      "alignment_unit_index": 44,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 46,
      "source_human_sha256": "1a257fcd2755c65f738cfa51485bc24890888bf59a5253a1d430af901f8b0890",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 46,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I don't know, but I have an instinctive feeling that it will be.",
      "output_sha256": "cac3cc2632c9fad421266d50bda652dfe68ec269ca7898a86a72653a72daf4db",
      "alignment_unit_index": 45,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 47,
      "source_human_sha256": "cac3cc2632c9fad421266d50bda652dfe68ec269ca7898a86a72653a72daf4db",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 47,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "Perhaps the wasp gun suggests a deficiency in silver spoons designed for such lethal purposes.",
      "output_sha256": "b06c1eed970bed3f7208be06660a8acfa4b33e817fc945d80c150b1c1d206be9",
      "alignment_unit_index": 46,
      "alignment_score": 0.604943,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        48
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "ec03150f029203901f84c3aa753dc5f2e0a86fbe48771d88dc01c00df57d60b3"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 42,
      "source_ai_sha256": "b06c1eed970bed3f7208be06660a8acfa4b33e817fc945d80c150b1c1d206be9",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        42
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 48,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Perhaps it shows too careful a consideration of the marmalade.",
      "output_sha256": "47c5e4ad754521fbe29f4685a51fd3f8d308f356b40ea2c7441cf589d5d90003",
      "alignment_unit_index": 47,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 49,
      "source_human_sha256": "47c5e4ad754521fbe29f4685a51fd3f8d308f356b40ea2c7441cf589d5d90003",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 49,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "A man of money drowns his wasp in the jar with his spoon, and carelessly calls for another pot to be opened.",
      "output_sha256": "015bb0ddfcb2a1fee7f7bd363d39be3570e167383525b9987002fdf92d38ad80",
      "alignment_unit_index": 48,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 50,
      "source_human_sha256": "015bb0ddfcb2a1fee7f7bd363d39be3570e167383525b9987002fdf92d38ad80",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 50,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "In contrast, a less fortunate person waits on the sidelines with their gun, while the marmalade remains free of casualties, ready to be served.",
      "output_sha256": "d65c44b712b9dcca3e04e7ffe6b19ab3f5f29eb8462780a8337f09cb9b234efe",
      "alignment_unit_index": 49,
      "alignment_score": 0.39413,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "780507e060f0d625efd112e0eb2b2c570b054e975afa48ede1bb53a4aa3825e6"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 45,
      "source_ai_sha256": "d65c44b712b9dcca3e04e7ffe6b19ab3f5f29eb8462780a8337f09cb9b234efe",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        45
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 51,
      "paragraph_index": 7,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "Your gun proclaims your poverty; then let it be avoided.",
      "output_sha256": "414da22d1ad33a044b9127396ce73917b9385602aa294a99db4ae13113eee12e",
      "alignment_unit_index": 50,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 52,
      "source_human_sha256": "414da22d1ad33a044b9127396ce73917b9385602aa294a99db4ae13113eee12e",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 52,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "All the same I think I shall have one.",
      "output_sha256": "580f6e6e98ec8aa9d21c98df1fb7ed986004cd0c964c9fdd75dc172b6f78d21d",
      "alignment_unit_index": 51,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 53,
      "source_human_sha256": "580f6e6e98ec8aa9d21c98df1fb7ed986004cd0c964c9fdd75dc172b6f78d21d",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 53,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "I have kept clear of hat- guards and Richards and made-up ties without quite knowing why, but honestly I have not felt the loss of them.",
      "output_sha256": "cf3beba04749211be0f90efa8c91a624eedcdb9d8cad928bd048feabad42722c",
      "alignment_unit_index": 52,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 54,
      "source_human_sha256": "cf3beba04749211be0f90efa8c91a624eedcdb9d8cad928bd048feabad42722c",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 54,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "The wasp gun is different; having seen it, I feel that I should be miserable without it.",
      "output_sha256": "b1bddde79a81ab63c21af7218173a29136e009102d16e4f900eb6dd503c67b10",
      "alignment_unit_index": 53,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 55,
      "source_human_sha256": "b1bddde79a81ab63c21af7218173a29136e009102d16e4f900eb6dd503c67b10",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 55,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "It is going to be excellent sport, wasp-shooting; a steady hand, a good eye, and a certain amount of courage will be called for.",
      "output_sha256": "83deb566ab7b6f744fbbb54fc2f8b4ea0bc736120802c7c1bbf1f41dedbc80f7",
      "alignment_unit_index": 54,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 56,
      "source_human_sha256": "83deb566ab7b6f744fbbb54fc2f8b4ea0bc736120802c7c1bbf1f41dedbc80f7",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 56,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "ai",
      "text": "When the season commences, I will be there, regardless of whether it is considered acceptable or not.",
      "output_sha256": "1e638fcd9c24d898a6a6a65409c3c1fad0f945d7d980d66e5d6527f6c478f6a3",
      "alignment_unit_index": 55,
      "alignment_score": 0.459095,
      "human_sentence_indices": [
        57
      ],
      "human_sha256": [
        "f98930cebb278108444385d21f6b0df5e399dcf84c099e9a8b7696d648337d10"
      ],
      "source_ai_sentence_index": 51,
      "source_ai_sha256": "1e638fcd9c24d898a6a6a65409c3c1fad0f945d7d980d66e5d6527f6c478f6a3",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": [
        51
      ]
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 57,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "We shall shoot the apple-quince coverts first.",
      "output_sha256": "64f79cf8109c31539553b3c3bd882346844f360350d2c6a4c2b13d9e64de7e0f",
      "alignment_unit_index": 56,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 58,
      "source_human_sha256": "64f79cf8109c31539553b3c3bd882346844f360350d2c6a4c2b13d9e64de7e0f",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    },
    {
      "sentence_index": 58,
      "paragraph_index": 8,
      "origin": "human",
      "text": "\"Hornet over!\"",
      "output_sha256": "022ad847f2e40b70607c56f9bbd9eae21778bf02400a1d1b0249a3a1bd51e356",
      "alignment_unit_index": 57,
      "alignment_score": null,
      "source_human_sentence_index": 59,
      "source_human_sha256": "022ad847f2e40b70607c56f9bbd9eae21778bf02400a1d1b0249a3a1bd51e356",
      "ai_unit_sentence_indices": []
    }
  ]
}
